      value: "\xBBYou can\u2019t plant new apple trees in the soil of old apple trees
        because the grown mycelium matches the old ones. The new trees will bear
        no fruit.\xAB \n\nDas erz\xE4hlt mir einer der G\xE4rtner beim Zur\xFCckschneiden
